# Pinned browser files for tools/ui-vendor.sh. One line per file, fields
# separated by spaces: name version tarball-URL path-inside-the-tarball sha256.
#
# `name` is the file's name under internal/ui/static/js/. The SHA-256 is of the
# extracted file, so `check` can verify what is committed without the network.
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.
#
# To update: change the version and URL, run `tools/ui-vendor.sh fetch` (it
# prints the new sum and refuses to write the file), put the sum here, run
# `fetch` again, and commit the new file. Compare the sum with the registry's
# own tarball checksum (`npm view <package>@<version> dist.shasum`) first.

